# Who can approve a change to lynkrobotics.org
#
# Every file in this repository is owned by the website maintainers. Combined
# with the branch protection rules on `main` (see SETUP.md → "Who can propose
# and who can publish"), this means a pull request cannot be merged until
# someone on this list approves it.
#
# Manage the people, not this file: add or remove members of the
# website-maintainers team at
# https://github.com/orgs/LynkRobotics/teams/website-maintainers
#
# @rjbell4 is listed as a fallback so approvals still work if the team is ever
# renamed or emptied. Remove that entry once the team is well established.

* @LynkRobotics/website-maintainers @rjbell4
